# Raw source-API response cache (ENGINEERING CHOICE, 2026-08-06).
# Re-fetchable via scripts/stage0_acquire.py; the committed artefacts are the
# content-hashed snapshot under data/snapshots/ and the acquisition manifest,
# which together record exactly what was retrieved. Raw pages are a cache,
# not a scientific artefact, and grow ~30MB per acquisition.
data/raw/*/*/*/page_*.json
data/raw/*/*/*/_count.json
data/audit/
